WEBVTT

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:36.680
Parental supervision is advised for children under the age of 13

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:04.520
Q-quickly...

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:06.430
Flee this place.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.390
Don't overexert yourself, Fire Sage.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.810
It's... it's too late.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.810
Who are you?

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.310
Amusing.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.470
Too slow.

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:45.640
They've finally arrived.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:53.810
That's...

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:16.850
Xuan

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:45.850
Bro...

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.930
Fire Aspect,

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.100
you've recklessly opened the Seal.

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.560
Now my son is missing,

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.930
and chaos has descended in the Demon Realm.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.470
Bring back my son,

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:18.350
and I'll return your loved ones.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:22.140
Brother!!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:39.350
Man’s snowy path is cleared by wind, while Beasts seek refuge in the woods.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:43.390
The Demon’s discord blazes bright, while Spirits on the mountain roam.

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:47.470
The dawn begets meditation, the noon-time bell calls all to work,

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:51.730
in evening there is wisdom found, and the nighttime drums guide lost souls home.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:55.270
The fog lifts and Man awakes,

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:58.370
as the mountain rises above the clouds.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.930
The Five Virtues shape the circle of life,

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:08.640
yet their justice may be untrue.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.810
Good and Evil tread the same path,

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:27.850
and there is wisdom in the words of mortals,

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:30.140
yet Heaven and Earth pay little heed,

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.970
for they trivialize mortals' passions.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.930
Man, Demon, Beasts and Spirits have all said:

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:36.140
We of Ying and Yang bear no power,

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.850
yet Heaven’s rule holds no permanence,

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:40.850
and the Ten Celestial Branches shall emerge from the chaos.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:47.100
Can evil’s demise be considered justice?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:54.550
The stars shall bear witness and judge.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:19.520
Episode 1 - Sacred Flames Renewed

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:51.680
Mountain Sage!

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:55.600
You're early today.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.100
Yep!

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:59.470
I found some great spots yesterday, and picked a ton today!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.350
Put that down and take a little break.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.930
I'm almost done here.

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:07.100
You can take that to your father.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:11.430
Alright, I'm off!

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.850
Take it easy!

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:14.560
Don't trip over yourself.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:15.930
Got it!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.180
This child...

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:41.060
I've been feeling amazing lately, ever since I've started taking these herbs.

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:43.430
Agreed.

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:47.020
The rheumatism I've had all these years has been dampened quite a bit as well.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:49.810
I gotta say, these herbs are quite miraculous.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:54.270
It's been especially effective for my kidneys.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.970
(TL Note: Kidneys are often associated with libido / sexual vitality)

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:00.520
No wonder you seem to disappear around dusk these days.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.770
Ha... No kidding!

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:11.220
Yo, Xiao An.

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:14.470
It's so early, where'd you go and get all those herbs from?

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.220
Morning Sixth Uncle, Seventh Uncle. I went to the far side of the mountain today.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.560
The far side... how dangerous...

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:24.350
How about I check your pulse and give you a physical examination later?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:26.060
No need! Thanks Sixth Uncle!

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.060
You old perv,

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.970
you can't even keep your hands off Third Brother's daughter?

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:29.770
Don't slander me!

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:31.770
I'm considering marrying her...

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.640
to my son, of course!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:34.890
Your son?

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:38.100
What are you laughing at?

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.430
What's wrong with my son?

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.680
He's inherited all of my charisma and good looks!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.600
It's almost noon...

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.930
I have to go collect rent.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:08.390
Fifth Uncle,

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:10.020
here's all the herbs I've picked today.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:11.930
Not bad...

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:13.220
Quite a variety.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:14.520
I'll give you a bonus.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:15.890
Thanks Fifth Uncle!

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.430
Is Father in the inner chambers?

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:19.640
He just finished treating 3 patients,

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.600
and is free at the moment.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:21.310
Cool.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.470
That hurt...

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.430
Always so reckless...

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:35.470
The medicine's Qi has been disrupted.

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:39.720
Haven't I told you before? The inner chambers are forbidden.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.520
You are not to enter without my permission.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.970
Sorry, Dad.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.180
You're not hurt, right?

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:48.600
Not at all.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.430
I'll need a replacement.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.680
You can repurpose this.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.810
I’d like to stay with the Mountain Sage for a couple days.

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:58.640
Ever since I was a kid, she's always looked out for me.

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:01.020
and recently, the pain in her legs have flared up again.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:03.810
The Mountain Sage has provided a lot of herbs for us.

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:04.350
Is that okay?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.060
That's fine.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.300
It's not often that you show concern for your elders.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.180
Thanks dad!

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:12.810
Wait...

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:16.770
My gallipot is broken, you must take responsibility for that as well.

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.100
Uh, that's...

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:22.140
Zhang the Drunk lives at the far side of the mountain.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:24.850
I have all my gallipots custom made by him.

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.930
I happen to have another order ready for pickup.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.270
So this time...

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:29.560
you go retrieve them in my stead.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.140
No problem, I've got it covered.

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:35.270
There are many forked paths, and Miasmic Qi gathers after dark.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.560
Return swiftly.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:40.350
No worries.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.430
I'll get your gallipots without a hitch.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.100
Call for the Mountain Sage.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.180
Ok.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:35.140
I can't believe there's someone actually living all the way out here.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:37.680
If I'm not careful I really could get lost here.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:40.350
Zhang the Drunk?

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:45.600
No... three people?

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:49.390
Something's not right

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:56.350
If you please...

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.850
Nearby...

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:59.810
Does there stand a village?

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:07.600
We brothers three have traveled a long way.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.220
Our bodies are exhausted...

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:12.890
And we would like a place to pause and rest for the night.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.560
If you please...

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:21.100
Continuestraightfor3kilometersthereisabanyantree, thenheadleftfor10kilometers,

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.350
crossthemountaincreeksandheadrightfor5kilometers,

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:24.060
crossthebridge, throughthestream, halfwayaroundthepont, jumpoverthemound.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:25.890
Ourvillageisastraightshotfromthere!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:26.770
Yep!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:27.390
Exactly!

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:33.520
Thank You.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:36.780
They believed me so easily?

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:43.430
Those guys were so freaky.

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:45.200
I'm so relieved they didn't notice the silver.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.470
W-where am I?

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.810
<b><i>I'M LOST</i></b><u></u>

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:11.270
Sacred Shrouded Mountain?

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:34.310
What kind of weird thing was that?

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.720
DIE YOU PERV!!!

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:48.230
Third Brother

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:53.850
Third Brother, what is it?

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.640
It seems that Eldest Brother has run out of Panacea,

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.230
and he requests that we send some more.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:03.230
What?

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.230
Didn't we deliver a batch just a few days ago?

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:08.230
You and Seventh Brother... make another trip.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:09.810
But...

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:12.600
There is no need for further discussion.

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:15.560
Eldest Brother also has the prosperity of our village in mind.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.810
We all want what's for the best.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:20.140
That's...

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:20.810
Sixth, Sixth...

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:21.720
Leave, leave, leave...

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:32.430
The two of us are always stuck doing the tedious work.

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:33.470
And all of them...

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.180
just sip tea and count money!

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:38.640
Sixth Brother you mustn't speak so loudly, Third Brother will overhear you.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:39.890
Heard schmeard,

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:40.770
I'm not afraid of him.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:41.720
And you!

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:45.230
Your coffers are overflowing, yet you're incapable of having a good time!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.220
I got peeked on and beat up...

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.520
This is a first, even for me.

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.270
Sorry sorry!

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:58.480
And you...

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:01.890
I'm gonna turn you into braised duck the next time you run around like that!

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:03.680
This is a first for me too.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:08.480
What are you even doing here by yourself?

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.310
What time is it?

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:12.430
Just past Wei. (16:00)

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:16.390
I'm screwed, Dad send me here to pick up gallipots from Zhang the Drunk.

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:19.230
There's no way I can get back to the village before dusk.

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:21.390
What a coincidence!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.230
You're looking for the old man?

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.390
I know a shortcut...

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.730
and we'll get you back to the village before dark.

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.390
Really?

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:29.850
But we just met...

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.100
Why should I believe you?

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:34.270
Well... You can beat me in a fight.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:36.270
Fair enough, lets go.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.100
She believed me so easily?

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:47.730
By the way, what does the "Sacred Shrouded Mountain" written on that slab mean?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.140
You don't know?

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:51.230
How about you buy one of my ducks and I'll tell you?

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:53.560
All of these ducks spend every day as energetic as can be.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.230
Each one of them is super healthy and plump.

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:56.940
Steam 'em, stew 'em, fry 'em, grill 'em, roast 'em,

00:17:56.940 --> 00:18:00.350
No matter how you cook them, they're a one of a kind delicacy!

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:04.180
I'll consider buying one...

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.730
if I like your explanation.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.640
Long long ago...

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:14.180
The Sacred Shrouded Mountain was home to all manner of vicious monsters.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:18.730
They would hunt and devour people, and no evil was too great for them.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.100
Humanity could not fight back...

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.850
They could only accept that they were food for the demons.

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.940
Then, as humanity reached the peak of their despair,

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.940
five powerful Aspects appeared.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:33.350
Drawing powerful Qi from the Yin Yang of Earth and Sky,

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:38.270
they harnessed the five mythical elements of Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, Earth,

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:42.100
and were able to drive the demons to the peak of the mountain.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:48.180
They formed the Great Seal and sealed within it the greatest and most awful of the demons.

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:52.230
The five Aspects then consecrated each of the mountain's exits with a pillar each their own,

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:55.060
preventing the lessor demons from escaping the mountain...

00:18:55.060 --> 00:19:00.600
and creating order between the worlds of the demons and the humans.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:05.020
Since then, no more conflict emerged among the humans.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:07.730
And the was peace amongst man.

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:11.930
Isn't that just a folk tale?

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:14.310
And among five Aspects, Fire was definitely the strongest.

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:16.970
They had the wit, beauty, charisma, style, coolness, sexual appeti....

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:19.310
Wait not that last one...

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.930
Hey... I wasn't done talking...

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:24.770
Well,

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:27.850
while the most awful demon was sealed, the lesser ones were not,

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.890
so it's to play it safe and keep those guys away, too.

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:35.600
No wonder I felt chills then.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:36.430
Wait, wait...

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:38.310
How do you know so much about this?

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.100
We're here.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.720
I'm back, old man.

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:53.600
It reeks of booze.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:05.100
Damn old man, you're drunk again. Your hearth's gone cold.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:08.930
Quit your yammering...

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:12.430
I, I haven't slept for two days.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:18.600
Why not be a little more considerate of your elders?

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:25.890
Oh, what's this, you brought a beautiful young lady back with you?

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:28.640
Oh no, it's not like that!

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:29.680
Ah, well you see...

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:33.020
The Head of Di Shan village sent me here for your custom-made gallipots.

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.390
Here's the silver. Feel free to count it.

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:36.890
Ah, that guy...

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.350
Xuan!

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:44.520
Bring that cushioned box over here for the young lady.

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:48.350
Sounds kinda weird...

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.970
Did you make all this china?

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:53.310
They're gorgeous!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:57.850
No, those are all made by Xuan.

00:20:57.850 --> 00:21:00.470
His technique is much more refined than mine.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.680
The duck farmer?

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:12.270
Hey, why do all of these have a gouge somewhere on them?

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.560
In the past, that boy made a mistake...

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:19.930
He does it to remind himself of it.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:22.600
A mistake...

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.770
This it?

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:24.890
Let's get going.

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:29.140
If it gets too late and we can't see the roads, you're on your own.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:30.020
Oh!

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:31.350
Hang on a second!

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.390
Old man Zhang, I'll be going!

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:41.640
I don't even know your name yet.

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:42.470
Su Xiao An.

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:45.310
What's yours? The old man called you Xuan.

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:47.600
Xuan takes the character for cliff.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:49.350
Hey, why'd you bring a duck with you?

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:50.600
You bought it, ma'am

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.640
When did I agree to that?

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:55.060
Hey, don't back out on your word now!

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:57.100
You're just hard selling me now.

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:59.480
I don't even have a single cent left.

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.850
Would you look at that, it seems I've forgotten the way down the mountain!

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:08.890
It gets more and more difficult every time.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:10.680
I've just about had enough!

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:12.430
Sixth, keep the complaining down a little...

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.100
I'll treat you to a drink later.

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.060
Bullwhip.

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:16.770
Okay!

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:18.140
Ten of them.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:20.270
So demanding.

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:20.850
Okay!

00:22:27.390 --> 00:22:28.390
Third, Fifth...

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:30.140
Did something happen?

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:31.930
Grab your "partners", let's have a look.

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:32.770
'kay.

00:22:44.720 --> 00:22:45.850
Shi...

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:48.140
They killed Shi!

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.100
And Lu, she's dead too!

00:22:54.020 --> 00:22:56.310
This is the place, no doubt.

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.480
Open the door, please, let me in!

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:04.020
Open the door! Li Zi is still out there!

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:06.470
Do you want to see him die, too?

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:07.470
We can't.

00:23:07.470 --> 00:23:09.350
If we open the door, we ALL die!

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:12.930
Open the door, I don't want to die!

00:23:19.140 --> 00:23:20.560
Who are you people?

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:21.890
What are you planning to do here?

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:23.700
Village Head.

00:23:47.390 --> 00:23:48.810
Careful, Fifth...

00:23:48.810 --> 00:23:50.850
That bastard isn't an easy foe.

00:23:59.020 --> 00:24:01.640
Those three weirdos from earlier...

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:04.680
And Brother Rock and Sister Green...

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:06.350
What happened to them?

00:24:07.930 --> 00:24:08.560
Don't move!

00:24:09.850 --> 00:24:11.720
Let me go! I need to go over there!

00:24:11.720 --> 00:24:13.270
They're already dead.

00:24:13.270 --> 00:24:14.640
I won't believe that!

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:15.720
Let go of me!

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:17.020
Let me go see them!

00:25:04.350 --> 00:25:05.350
What...?

00:25:06.520 --> 00:25:07.350
Fifth!
Fifth!

00:25:08.600 --> 00:25:09.850
Fifth...

00:25:23.810 --> 00:25:25.230
It won't penetrate...?

00:25:27.770 --> 00:25:29.560
Fifth, get out of the way!

00:25:41.430 --> 00:25:41.980
Dad!

00:25:48.270 --> 00:25:50.730
How could this be?

00:25:51.680 --> 00:25:53.600
Fifth!

00:26:29.140 --> 00:26:31.730
The Fire Aspect of the Shrouded Mountain...

00:26:32.640 --> 00:26:36.230
The Shrouded Mountain's ... Aspect of Fire?

00:26:36.930 --> 00:26:38.680
He's...

00:26:38.680 --> 00:26:40.730
the Fire Aspect of the Shrouded Mountain?

00:26:41.020 --> 00:26:42.640
At that moment...

00:26:42.640 --> 00:26:45.520
I suddenly felt an intense fear,

00:26:45.520 --> 00:26:47.810
of the strength...

00:26:47.810 --> 00:26:49.230
of the meekness of... humanity.

00:26:55.350 --> 00:26:58.220
Have you forgotten your own oath?

00:26:59.560 --> 00:27:00.640
The duck...

00:27:00.640 --> 00:27:02.390
That duck just talked!!!

00:27:03.520 --> 00:27:04.770
Demon!

00:27:04.770 --> 00:27:06.390
They're all demons!
